{"id":"by-bajq.3.16","title":"Offer dredge for a card milled earlier in the same run","description":"replace::may_ask (beryl_rules/src/replace.rs) is read when a resolution or a step's turn-based actions begin: it is true only while a dredge card already sits in a graveyard with enough cards in its owner's library. A run that starts with it false is not opened to pause, so a replacement choice met later in that run takes its first candidate (replace::choose), which for dredge is declining.

Symptom: Jace, Wielder of Mysteries' +1 ('Target player mills two cards. Draw a card.') targeting its controller mills Life from the Loam, and the draw that follows is not offered dredge 3 (CR 702.52a: dredge works from the graveyard at the time of the draw; ruling: a card milled by an earlier dredge may replace a later draw).

Fix options: widen may_ask while a game has a dredge card (Capability::Dredge) to cover a dredge card in a library or hand that the run could mill or discard, or reopen the run when choose() meets a choice with the channel closed (run again on the copy from its start). Keep the absent-cost gate: games without dredge must pay only the table bit. Files: beryl_rules/src/replace.rs (may_ask, choose), resolve.rs (resolve, resolve_on_copy), engine/paused_step.rs. Test: a Life from the Loam scenario with Jace +1 milling it, then dredging the draw.","acceptance_criteria":"A Life from the Loam scenario where Jace, Wielder of Mysteries' +1 mills Life from the Loam and the following draw is offered dredge passes just card check (Beryl, XMage, Forge). just count-gate shows no rise for the WU mirror.","status":"in_progress","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"local_ce2b4aa8-b291-4649-9a86-f3862695d15f","owner":"ci@example.com","created_at":"2026-11-14T19:52:40Z","created_by":"Derek Thurn","updated_at":"2026-11-14T20:04:57Z","started_at":"2026-11-14T20:02:52Z","metadata":{"enact_run":"by-bajq","enact_actor":"local_ce2b4aa8-b291-4649-9a86-f3862695d15f","enact_branch":"enact/by-bajq.3.16","enact_vizier":"d16a0e78-bc6d-4744-8ab1-6e9cdc28b3a2","enact_session":"local_ce2b4aa8-b291-4649-9a86-f3862695d15f","enact_worktree":"/Users/dthurn/beryl/.worktrees/by-bajq.3.16","enact_spawn_app":"claude","enact_spawn_host":"jarvis","enact_reservation":"c927358cf5c0460ca045f4119deb32c2","enact_pool_session":"local_ce2b4aa8-b291-4649-9a86-f3862695d15f","enact_spawn_project":"/Users/dthurn/beryl","enact_worktree_host":"jarvis","enact_spawn_provider":"claude"},"labels":["role:executor","tier:opus"]}

