{"id":"by-bajq.6.9","title":"Spell copies are never scripted onto the stack, so script checks fail for Fork and Brain Freeze","description":"Symptom: `beryl_cli script-check` (the fast check's `script` lane) fails 24 spec moments on staging since 3cfaa15b4 (feat: spell copies and storm): 15 of brain-freeze and 9 of fork, from both seats. Each panics in beryl_session/src/script/build.rs `verify` with a rule-invariant failure such as: `streak #512 > opponent damage 3 <- #512`: its cause #512 is not on the table as it runs, and did not leave it in this beat. Reproduce: `cd rust && cargo build -p beryl_cli && ./target/debug/beryl_cli script-check ../ui/fixtures.json fork` (or `brain-freeze`).

Why: a copy of a spell (slots 512 and up, e.g. Fork's copy of Lightning Bolt or Braingeyser, Brain Freeze's storm copies) is created on the stack and resolves, and its effects' steps name it as their cause, but no step of the script puts the copy on the table (no appear onto the stack) or takes it off (vanish), so check.rs `rule` finds the cause absent. The script needs the copy's arrival on the stack and its departure as steps (see script/mod.rs 'Cause' and 'Reset', build.rs/moves.rs/stack.rs for how a spell's flight to the stack and its resolution are scripted, and Heard/Names in hear.rs for how the stack is followed). Arena shows a copy appearing on the stack beside the original; look it up with the arena-video skill before choosing the verb.

This blocks every push whose fast check runs the `script` lane (any change to beryl_session, beryl_cli or a card crate). by-q44s.1.25 is waiting on it.","acceptance_criteria":"`beryl_cli script-check ../ui/fixtures.json` passes for every brain-freeze and fork moment from both seats; each copy of a spell is put on the stack and taken off it by steps of the script; `just timing-parity` still reports no differences.","status":"in_progress","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"local_ce2b4aa8-b291-4649-9a86-f3862695d15f","owner":"ci@example.com","created_at":"2026-11-15T07:00:43Z","created_by":"Derek Thurn","updated_at":"2026-11-15T07:11:06Z","started_at":"2026-11-15T07:03:45Z","metadata":{"enact_run":"by-bajq","enact_actor":"local_ce2b4aa8-b291-4649-9a86-f3862695d15f","enact_branch":"enact/by-bajq.6.9","enact_vizier":"d16a0e78-bc6d-4744-8ab1-6e9cdc28b3a2","enact_session":"local_ce2b4aa8-b291-4649-9a86-f3862695d15f","enact_worktree":"/Users/dthurn/beryl/.worktrees/by-bajq.6.9","enact_spawn_app":"claude","enact_spawn_host":"jarvis","enact_reservation":"fa43545db6044ff980ac67b7b7f8a27e","enact_pool_session":"local_ce2b4aa8-b291-4649-9a86-f3862695d15f","enact_spawn_project":"/Users/dthurn/beryl","enact_worktree_host":"jarvis","enact_spawn_provider":"claude"},"labels":["role:executor","tier:opus"]}

