  card's spring, the open spans, the running effects and notices, and the scroll offsets;
- a frame that differs when the frames before it were skipped: draw each moment of
  `stress-verbs` directly and after stepping every tick, and compare;
- a span that is drawn after the step that ended it, or lost across a script, a reset or a
  resize;
- an arrow whose ends are not on its two things in every frame of a flight of either;
- an effect that moves a resolved element, delays `Show::settled`, or is still listed
  after its run;
- a card with dissolve, whiten or an opacity under 1 left among the opaque records, or an
  opaque card among the blended ones;
- a record in the wrong band, so that the depth test cannot hide a mark under a covering
  card;
- an allocation in `Client::frame` on a frame that starts a script, begins an effect or
  opens a span;
- a step the laying out again of by-q44s.3.32 moves while it has a segment;
- a material that reads a field the doc's table does not give it, or takes a second
  texture sample;
- a difference from the web's function of the same name that no comment explains: compare
