  line;
- each verb's values measured against data/ui-conventions.json: play each case of each
  verb in a hand-built script and compare the measured duration, delay and stagger with
  the data.

Report in a comment: for each of the 16 verbs and 14 effects, the recording and moment you
watched it at with `just b3d film`, and what you changed.

