What to do: find out whether the session's script builder (rust/crates/beryl_protocol/src/script, rust/crates/beryl_session) omits the step for a spell that moves itself to exile as part of its own resolution, and how the web interface shows it (`just b3d timeline`, ui/scripts/timeline.mjs). If the script lacks the step, that is a session change, which reaches both clients (epic rule 7b). If the step is there and Beryl 3D drops it, fix the client. The fault is listed in data/beryl3d/test-faults.json (rest-placement, +1 in each of the 12 tests of the two fork/copies-time-spiral recordings) until this is fixed.","acceptance_criteria":"`just b3d test b3d:fork/copies-time-spiral` passes with the rest-placement entries of those tests lowered by one (`just b3d test --update`), and the original Time Spiral is seen moving from the stack to exile in `just b3d film fork/copies-time-spiral-which-exiles-the-copy-first --from 9700ms --to 10200ms`.","status":"in_progress","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"vizier:jarvis:claude:32f74257-d3b1-4102-8f70-a1d50feaf650","owner":"ci@example.com","created_at":"2026-11-16T03:13:46Z","created_by":"Derek Thurn","updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:59:30Z","started_at":"2026-11-16T04:59:30Z","lease_expires_at":"2026-11-16T05:04:30Z","heartbeat_at":"2026-11-16T04:59:30Z","metadata":{"enact_run":"by-q44s","enact_vizier":"32f74257-d3b1-4102-8f70-a1d50feaf650","enact_spawn_app":"claude","enact_spawn_host":"jarvis","enact_reservation":"f47981b14a22410294e4351b29c4b061","enact_pool_session":"local_c30acc3f-956b-47f2-8f8f-3ba99acc7124","enact_spawn_project":"/Users/dthurn/beryl","enact_spawn_provider":"claude"},"labels":["role:executor","tier:opus"]}

