{"id":"by-q44s.5.49","title":"Manual table: the lobby screen (solo, host, join, deck, ready)","description":"The web interface now prepares every manual table in a lobby (ui/src/screens/Lobby.tsx, ui/src/table/lobby/TableEntries.tsx, commit fb79cc146): 'Solo table' calls tableLobby({kind: 'solo'}) and the lobby loads a deck, sets assists and starts the table. Beryl 3D's start screen instead starts a solo table directly with TableConnections::solo and the sample WU Control deck (beryl_scene src/manual/mod.rs solo_request, src/client/manual.rs start_table), because it has no lobby screen.

Build the lobby screen in beryl_scene (a new Screen or a table sub-screen; see src/screens/table.rs and the start screen src/screens/start.rs): SessionCommand variants for TableConnections::lobby (TableLobbyRequest with LobbyChange: View, Solo, LoadDeck, Sideboard, Ready, SetAssist, Settings, Start), answered on beryl_3d's session thread (src/session.rs Live, which already holds a TableConnections), the lobby's LobbyUpdate events reaching the client (Live::new passes |_| {} for table events today), and the 'Solo table' press going through the lobby as the web's does. Host and join need the link and are out of scope unless the web's lobby screen offers them without one.

Read first: docs/manual-multiplayer.md (lobby), rust/crates/beryl_table_session/src/connections.rs (lobby), rust/crates/beryl_protocol/src/ipc/table.rs (LobbyChange, LobbyUpdate), the lobby commands of data/table-commands.json (scope lobby; beryl_scene src/manual/commands.rs COMMANDS has them).","acceptance_criteria":"The start screen's 'Solo table' opens a lobby screen that shows the deck and starts the table; tests in beryl_scene tests/all build a LobbyUpdate by hand and press through it; screens.json lists the lobby with a screen recording and just b3d test passes on it; just b3d lane passes.","status":"in_progress","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"local_fd002e9a-a064-4ed7-a0f2-546462e3d6a1","owner":"ci@example.com","created_at":"2026-11-16T16:29:08Z","created_by":"Derek Thurn","updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:04:18Z","started_at":"2026-11-16T17:03:02Z","metadata":{"enact_run":"by-q44s","enact_actor":"local_fd002e9a-a064-4ed7-a0f2-546462e3d6a1","enact_branch":"enact/by-q44s.5.49","enact_vizier":"32f74257-d3b1-4102-8f70-a1d50feaf650","enact_session":"local_fd002e9a-a064-4ed7-a0f2-546462e3d6a1","enact_worktree":"/Users/dthurn/beryl/.worktrees/slot-07","enact_spawn_app":"claude","enact_spawn_host":"jarvis","enact_reservation":"109c2a4ca6074114a34511b605d55220","enact_pool_session":"local_fd002e9a-a064-4ed7-a0f2-546462e3d6a1","enact_spawn_project":"/Users/dthurn/beryl","enact_worktree_host":"jarvis","enact_spawn_provider":"claude"},"labels":["role:executor","tier:opus"]}

