{"id":"by-q44s.7.16","title":"b3d phone: creature rows end left of their start","description":"Symptom: `just b3d android-smoke` on staging at 9c38c8bff panicked in `lay_row` (rust/beryl3d/crates/beryl_scene/src/table/rows.rs) with 'min > max. min = 1, max = 0'. by-q44s.7.15 added a guard so an empty row no longer panics, but the cause remains.

Cause: 9c38c8bff ('b3d keeps creature rows clear of the stack') made `row_area` in rust/beryl3d/crates/beryl_scene/src/table/stack.rs end a creature row a gap left of the stack's furthest reach. On the phone's narrow portrait window that end lies left of the row's start, so the row's room is negative. A row with cards then shows a single pile (`shown` clamps to 1) instead of laying its cards out, and the row counts in hud/rows.rs sit at crossed ends.

Fix: make `row_area` keep a usable row on the phone layout (for example, apply the stack cut only where the stack's column is beside the rows, or clamp the end to leave room for the least strip), and add an interface test or check that fails when any row's right end is left of its left end on the phone sizes (393x759, 375x647, 430x932).","acceptance_criteria":"No battlefield row's area has right < left at the phone sizes, held by a test in beryl_scene; `just b3d android-smoke` passes; the desktop stress boards keep their reachable-check result.","status":"in_progress","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"local_c30acc3f-956b-47f2-8f8f-3ba99acc7124","owner":"ci@example.com","created_at":"2026-11-16T10:38:46Z","created_by":"Derek Thurn","updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:32:22Z","started_at":"2026-11-16T13:30:50Z","metadata":{"enact_run":"by-q44s","enact_actor":"local_c30acc3f-956b-47f2-8f8f-3ba99acc7124","enact_branch":"enact/by-q44s.7.16","enact_vizier":"32f74257-d3b1-4102-8f70-a1d50feaf650","enact_session":"local_c30acc3f-956b-47f2-8f8f-3ba99acc7124","enact_worktree":"/Users/dthurn/beryl/.worktrees/slot-01","enact_spawn_app":"claude","enact_spawn_host":"jarvis","enact_reservation":"6e5513d44613427f92a661af3edaa3de","enact_pool_session":"local_c30acc3f-956b-47f2-8f8f-3ba99acc7124","enact_spawn_project":"/Users/dthurn/beryl","enact_worktree_host":"jarvis","enact_spawn_provider":"claude"},"labels":["role:executor","tier:opus"]}

