{"id":"by-q44s.77","title":"Beryl 3D sweep pins its beads to a host name no vizier uses","description":"Beads the Beryl 3D sweep files on this Mac (for example by-q44s.65 and .66) carried enact_host=dereks-macbook-pro, but Enact's viziers on this Mac call the host jarvis (socket.gethostname() in an interactive shell returns JARVIS.local). Enact only hands a bead pinned with enact_host to a vizier on that host, so no vizier ever started them; the vizier unpinned .65 and .66 by hand on 2026-11-16.

Cause: tools/src/beryl_tools/nightly_failures.py host() uses ENACT_HOST or socket.gethostname(), and the sweep process (probably started by launchd or another background job) sees a different hostname from the shell the viziers run in. by-q44s.54 added the pinning; since by-q44s.72 the sweep only runs on the Mac, so the pin is not needed to keep Windows failures off this machine.

Fix: either stop pinning sweep beads with enact_host (keep enact_ci_host as a record), or make host() return the same name Enact's host_name() returns in every context (for example by setting ENACT_HOST in the sweep's job definition). Update tools/tests for the sweep. Done means a bead filed by a sweep on this Mac is offered to a vizier on this Mac.","status":"in_progress","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"local_ff743724-15be-4f39-9c98-3aba110a68a7","owner":"ci@example.com","created_at":"2026-11-16T19:28:45Z","created_by":"Derek Thurn","updated_at":"2026-11-16T19:31:48Z","started_at":"2026-11-16T19:30:39Z","metadata":{"enact_run":"by-q44s","enact_actor":"local_ff743724-15be-4f39-9c98-3aba110a68a7","enact_branch":"enact/by-q44s.77","enact_vizier":"32f74257-d3b1-4102-8f70-a1d50feaf650","enact_session":"local_ff743724-15be-4f39-9c98-3aba110a68a7","enact_worktree":"/Users/dthurn/beryl/.worktrees/slot-07","enact_spawn_app":"claude","enact_spawn_host":"jarvis","enact_reservation":"713ae3fd921945cd98cc552f381c172f","enact_pool_session":"local_ff743724-15be-4f39-9c98-3aba110a68a7","enact_spawn_project":"/Users/dthurn/beryl","enact_worktree_host":"jarvis","enact_spawn_provider":"claude"},"labels":["tier:sonnet"]}

