- a spell resolving to the graveyard, or to the top or bottom of a library (ZoneChange.library_top);
- a countered spell (A countered spell: it leaves first; the strike on it is by-w8gv.21.21's verb, composed here);
- returns to hand (An opponent's spell returned to hand; not-seen: Your own spell returned to hand);
- exile: A batch exile; linked exile under its host (exception 6) and its return (not-seen; linkedReturnFlights in beats.ts);
- a card cast from a graveyard or from exile;
