{"id":"by-w8gv.21.37","title":"Desktop stack card 3.4x a battlefield card; Arena ~1.9x","description":"The stepped capture (`just motion`, tools/src/beryl_tools/motion.py, by-w8gv.21.19) measures fly's "permanent resolves" case: the card's largest size in its flight from the stack, over its size at rest on the battlefield. On the desktop stage (1600x900, the verb suite's Overlord moment, ui/verbs.json) it reads 3.43 from your seat and 3.31 from theirs. Arena's instances read 1.5 to 2.0 (median 1.9; with the tolerance, 1.215 to 2.285), so the check is waived in data/arena-motion.json (fly, waivers: peak, "permanent resolves", naming this bead).

Cause: layout, not the verb's motion. The desktop stage lays the stack's card out at about 3.4 times a battlefield card (ui/src/stage/desktop.ts, the stack column; ui/src/game/layout.ts STACK), where Arena's stack card is about 1.9 times its slot (the instances' notes in data/arena-motion.json, fly). The flight itself matches Arena: it travels, eases out (half way at 0.6 of its path at half its time) and lasts the verb's value.

Do: check docs/ui-conventions.md for an exception that covers the stack card's size (none as of 2026-11-11). Per K22 the table layout is Arena's: bring the stack card's size over a battlefield card's within Arena's range (the arena-video skill: SswBO8aOOgc 20:12.1, UrGalw_f35w 17:01.0, pE4XSNi-nZc 23:02.5), keeping the stack readable at the desktop's window sizes (ui/shots.json); file a bead labelled human saying what to look at. Then remove the waiver and run `just motion`. If the large stack card should stay, make it a numbered exception in data/ui-conventions.json and leave the waiver naming that change.","acceptance_criteria":"just motion passes with the fly peak waiver for "permanent resolves" removed from data/arena-motion.json, or a numbered exception in data/ui-conventions.json covers the stack card's size and the waiver's reason names it; just ui-test and just ui-shots pass; just check passes.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"fc331fab-8c42-4165-b918-525f438ead54","owner":"ci@example.com","created_at":"2026-11-11T16:29:28Z","created_by":"Derek Thurn","updated_at":"2026-11-11T17:33:24Z","started_at":"2026-11-11T17:03:44Z","closed_at":"2026-11-11T17:33:24Z","close_reason":"Resolve peaks retaken in the tracker's unit; stack card 236->204; waiver removed, just motion passes; staging 41fa67de","metadata":{"enact_run":"by-w8gv","enact_runs":"by-w8gv","enact_actor":"fc331fab-8c42-4165-b918-525f438ead54","enact_branch":"enact/by-w8gv.21.37","enact_vizier":"d9cae4ca-c7c1-414a-8d3f-6373d9b06723","enact_commits":"dd7d5570e39bb8cde085bfecf93f593af3f79401 41fa67de308c1b4957379e6c6f897c2f0fceb1b4","enact_session":"fc331fab-8c42-4165-b918-525f438ead54","enact_worktree":"/Users/dthurn/beryl/.worktrees/by-w8gv.21.37","enact_spawn_app":"claude","enact_spawn_host":"jarvis","enact_reservation":"7b211cfd0fe14be1b0ac3eb1d9dba5e6","enact_spawn_project":"/Users/dthurn/beryl","enact_worktree_host":"jarvis","enact_spawn_provider":"claude"},"labels":["la