{"id":"by-w8gv.21.38","title":"Stepped capture holds the zone-change cases to Arena","description":"by-w8gv.21.20 put the zone-change cases on the stage and in the verb suite, but the motion oracle (just motion: ui/scripts/stepped.mjs, tools/src/beryl_tools/motion.py) still captures only the suite's first moment (ui/verbs.json 'moment': a cast, its trigger, tokens). The cases played by the moments in 'more' (zones: fixtures verbs-zones and verbs-zones-theirs; scry: verbs-scry and verbs-scry-theirs) are held to Arena only in their values (data/ui-conventions.json verbs[].cases, derived from data/arena-motion.json), not in a capture. lift has no captured step at all and is waived in data/arena-motion.json (waivers, measure 'capture') naming this bead.

Do: have stepped.mjs also play each moment of 'more' to its recording's end (verbs.mjs walk with 'whole', ending(), complete() show how: answers = views that wait on one, plus one) and screenshot ONE step per (verb, Arena case, seat), the first of each: fly draw alone (held up: Arena peak 1.55 to 1.59), fly draws together, fly discard, fly opponent spell cast, vanish destroyed / countered / resolved / exiled / bounced / sacrificed, lift. Write them under <out>/<layout>/<seat>.<moment>/ with steps.json as now (motion.measure_capture globs */*/steps.json and reads 'seat' from the file). motion.case_of already names these cases (by where a vanish goes, then why; by the record's controller for a cast). A vanish is in place and fades: check what video_measure.seen reads for a fading card ('travel: in place'), and for the held draw that 'peak' reads the hold. Then remove lift's capture waiver.

Budget: the motion lane runs in the fast check (60 s) and took about 37 s before; every captured step costs its duration in 1/60 s screenshots. Measure, and if the lane cannot hold all of it, capture the new cases only nightly (nightly.py motion_step) and say so in motion.py's module doc. Record the measured peak of the held draw and any miss on the epic by-w8gv.21 as by-w8gv.21.19 did (waiver naming a follow-up, or bring the value in: ui/src/stage/desktop.ts DRAWN, ui/src/stage/tracks.ts HELD and TURN).","acceptance_criteria":"just motion captures a step of every zone-change case the suite's moments play (draw alone, draws together, discard, opponent's cast, each vanish case, lift) from both seats on the desktop and each verdict passes or is a waiver naming a bead; lift's capture waiver is gone; the motion lane's time is recorded on the bead and is inside the fast budget, or the new captures run nightly only with the reason in motion.py; just check passes.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","assignee":"local_587ca083-462b-414a-9060-5f71fb066688","owner":"ci@example.com","created_at":"2026-11-11T17:14:15Z","created_by":"Derek Thurn","updated_at":"2026-11-11T19:21:01Z","started_at":"2026-11-11T18:20:08Z","closed_at":"2026-11-11T19:21:01Z","close_reason":"Nightly by motion --more captures zones and scry: every fly, vanish and lift step timed, one per kind shot, all pass; lift's shot left to by-w8gv.21.46; staging 7003bf65","metadata":{"enact_run":"by-w8gv","enact_runs":"by-w8gv","enact_actor":"local_587ca083-462b-414a-9060-5f71fb066688","enact_branch":"enact/by-w8gv.21.38","enact_vizier":"d9cae4ca-c7c1-414a-8d3f-6373d9b06723","enact_commits":"a7509e450fe37ad1fbc6670b8f67d88eaca86497 7003bf652a35f1b7846495ee240b291167eade06","enact_session":"local_587ca083-462b-414a-9060-5f71fb066688","enact_worktree":"/Users/dthurn/beryl/.worktrees/by-w8gv.21.38","enact_spawn_app":"claude","enact_spawn_host":"jarvis","enact_reservation":"8cf9dad177384c60922ed053b7eb9d